[{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1006","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-25079","title":"D-Link DCS-2530L及DCS-2670L网络摄像头命令注入漏洞","description":"D-Link DCS-2530L（固件版本低于1.06.01 Hotfix）和DCS-2670L（固件版本至2.02）网络摄像头的ddns_enc.cgi接口存在命令注入漏洞。已认证的攻击者可通过向该CGI脚本发送特制的HTTP请求，在设备端注入并执行任意系统命令，从而完全控制目标设备。该漏洞允许攻击者以设备权限执行任意命令，可能导致敏感信息泄露、设备配置篡改或作为跳板攻击内网其他主机。攻击者只需具备设备Web管理界面的低权限账户即可远程利用，无需用户交互，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-25079"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-09-02T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:06:20Z","remediation":"DCS-2530L 用户通过 Mydlink 手机 App 升级固件至 v1.07.00 Hotfix；DCS-2670L 用户从 D-Link 官网下载并更新固件至 v2.03.00 Hotfix；DCS-4603/4622/4701E/4703E/4705E/4802E 系列用户下载对应 Hotfix 固件手动更新。DCS-P703 已停止服务，建议停用并更换设备。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或路由器层面限制对设备 80/443 端口的远程访问，仅允许受信任内网 IP 访问设备管理界面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://supportannouncement.us.dlink.com/announcement/publication.aspx?name=SAP10180","https://twitter.com/Dogonsecurity/status/1271265152118259712","https://support.dlink.com/productinfo.aspx?m=DCS-2530L","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-25079","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-25079.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2020/25xxx/CVE-2020-25079.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2020/25xxx/CVE-2020-25079.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-25079.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-25079.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-25079.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-25079.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2020/CVE-2020-25079.md","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/355cb847bc4d33c37a7ff6bd602777a6d36f0eed/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2020-25079","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-25079.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1000","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1000.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-25078","title":"D-Link DCS-2530L和DCS-2670L 信息泄露漏洞","description":"D-Link DCS-2530L（固件版本低于 1.06.01 Hotfix）和 DCS-2670L（固件版本 2.02 及之前）网络摄像头存在未授权访问漏洞。攻击原理在于设备固件中的 `/config/getuser` 接口缺少身份认证机制，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可直接向该接口发送 HTTP 请求，无需凭据即可获取设备管理员账户的用户名与明文密码。攻击条件为目标设备暴露于网络且可被外部访问，攻击者仅需使用基本的 HTTP 客户端工具即可完成利用，无需交互操作或特殊权限。漏洞影响所有未修复固件版本的 D-Link DCS-2530L 和 DCS-2670L 设备，成功利用后攻击者将获得管理员权限，进而完全控制目标摄像头，可能导致视频监控被窃取、设备被篡改或作为内网进一步渗透的跳板。CVSS v3.1 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-25078"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-09-02T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:06:20Z","remediation":"DCS-2530L 用户应立即升级固件至 v1.07.00 Hotfix（通过 Mydlink Mobile App 更新）；DCS-2670L 用户升级至 v2.03.00 Hotfix；DCS-4603 升级至 v1.04.02 Hotfix；DCS-4622 升级至 v2.01.10 Hotfix；DCS-4701E 升级至 v2.03.01 Hotfix；DCS-4703E 升级至 v1.03.04 Hotfix；DCS-4705E 升级至 v1.03.02 Hotfix；DCS-4802E 升级至 v2.01.01 Hotfix。DCS-P703 已停止服务，建议停用并更换设备。临时缓解措施：在防火墙或路由器层面限制对设备管理端口（80/443）的访问，仅允许受信任的内网 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://supportannouncement.us.dlink.com/announcement/publication.aspx?name=SAP10180","https://twitter.com/Dogonsecurity/status/1273251236167516161","https://support.dlink.com/productinfo.aspx?m=DCS-2530L","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-25078","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-25078.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-25078.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/1a583c77a151b9c5f4534bb6fe376ed9456e38c3/2020/CVE-2020-25078.md","https://github.com/jorhelp/Ingram/blob/166cd29f3252599417db8f657f25c2edcf55d853/Ingram/pocs/cve-2020-25078.py","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/iot/D-Link-DCS系列监控-账号密码信息泄露漏洞-CVE-2020-25078.md","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2020-25078.js","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-25078.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-25078.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-25078/poc/others/README.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/911f59febd1bbb3aa37b38750a1867e7a514757c/2020/CVE-2020-25078/README.md","https://github.com/tzwlhack/Vulnerability/blob/4ac07f1a2be4f76e19faf572fbbba2131d2c62ea/D-Link DCS系列监控 账号密码信息泄露 CVE-2020-25078.md","https://github.com/jorhelp/Ingram","https://github.com/1n7erface/PocList","https://github.com/MzzdToT/CVE-2020-25078","https://github.com/flags-alt/abyss-c2","https://github.com/chinaYozz/CVE-2020-25078"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1000.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0016","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-24557","title":"趋势科技 Apex One 及 Worry-Free Business Security 不当访问控制权限提升漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>趋势科技Apex One和Worry-Free Business Security 10.0 SP1在Microsoft Windows平台上存在不当访问控制漏洞。攻击者通过操纵特定产品文件夹可临时禁用安全防护功能，并滥用Windows系统特定函数实现特权升级。成功利用该漏洞需攻击者首先获得在目标系统上执行低权限代码的能力。该漏洞影响运行受影响版本Windows系统的设备，其中Windows 10 1909（OS Build 18363.719）及更高版本已缓解硬链接问题，而之前版本均受影响。攻击者可借此获取系统更高权限，进一步实施恶意操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-24557"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-09-01T19:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:05:45Z","remediation":"立即将趋势科技 Apex One 升级至 Build 11480、OfficeScan 升级至 Build 11480、Worry-Free Business Security 10.0 SP1 升级至最新补丁包（通过产品控制台的更新服务或官网下载中心获取）。同时将 Windows 10 升级至 1909 版本（OS Build 18363.719）及以上以启用硬链接缓解机制。如无法立即打补丁，可在组策略中禁用 SeCreateSymbolicLinkPrivilege 权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://success.trendmicro.com/solution/000263632","https://success.trendmicro.com/solution/000267260","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-20-1094/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-24557","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-24557.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/1a583c77a151b9c5f4534bb6fe376ed9456e38c3/2020/CVE-2020-24557.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-24557.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-24557.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-24557.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-24557.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2020-24557.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2020/CVE-2020-24557.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-24557.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2020/CVE-2020-24557.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0999","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0999.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-24363","title":"TP-Link TL-WA855RE 固件关键功能认证缺失漏洞","description":"TP-Link TL-WA855RE V5 固件存在关键功能认证缺失漏洞（CWE-306）。同一网络中的未认证攻击者可向设备发送特制的 TDDP_RESET POST 请求，触发设备恢复出厂设置并重启，随后攻击者可设置新的管理员密码获取设备完全控制权。该漏洞影响 TL-WA855RE V5 20200415-rel37464 版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高，已被 CISA KEV 收录确认在野利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-24363"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-08-31T16:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:05:25Z","remediation":"立即将 TL-WA855RE V5 固件升级至 200731 及以上版本，下载地址为 TP-Link 官方支持页面。升级前在路由器/防火墙层面限制对设备 80/443 端口的局域网访问，仅允许受信任管理主机连接。如无法升级，可在设备管理界面禁用远程管理和 TDDP 协议以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://malwrforensics.com/en/2020/08/31/cve-2020-24363-tl-wa855re-v5-advisory/","https://pastebin.com/VjHM4UiA","https://www.tp-link.com/us/support/download/tl-wa855re/#Firmware","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-24363","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49092","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-24363.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2020/24xxx/CVE-2020-24363.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2020/24xxx/CVE-2020-24363.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-24363.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-24363.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-24363.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2020-24363.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2020/CVE-2020-243xx/CVE-2020-24363.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2020/CVE-2020-24363.md","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/355cb847bc4d33c37a7ff6bd602777a6d36f0eed/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2020-24363"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0999.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0018","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3566","title":"Cisco IOS XR Software DVMRP 内存耗尽漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS XR Software 的距离向量多播路由协议（DVMRP）功能存在内存耗尽漏洞。该漏洞源于对 Internet Group Management Protocol（IGMP）数据包的队列管理不足，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 IGMP 流量来消耗其进程内存。成功的利用可导致内存耗尽，进而引发其他进程的不稳定，这些进程可能包括但不限于内部和外部路由协议。该漏洞影响运行受影响 IOS XR 软件版本的 Cisco 设备，CVSS v3.1 评分为 8.6，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3566"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-08-29T16:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:18:36Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-iosxr-dvmrp-memexh-dSmpdvfz","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3566","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49330","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3566.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-35669.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-3566.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-3566.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-35662.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-35667.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-35660.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-35664.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-35665.md","https://github.com/8lu3sh311/CVE-PoC/blob/0e321f89a2ba216d8a7eb6eb28590d1dc39a74c9/2020/CVE-2020-3566.md","https://github.com/n0npax/CVE-2020-35669","https://github.com/Diekgbbtt/CVE-2020-35667-PoC","https://github.com/stefan-500/teamcity-idea-cve-2020-35667-poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0509","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-1472","title":"Microsoft Windows Netlogon 权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Netlogon 远程协议（MS-NRPC）在处理安全通道连接时存在加密认证绕过漏洞（代号 ZeroLogon）。攻击者无需任何身份认证，通过网络向域控制器发送特制的 Netlogon 请求，利用 AES-CFB8 加密算法中计算初始向量为零时的缺陷，即可伪造计算机账户凭据，重置域控制器的机器账户密码，从而获取域管理员权限。该漏洞影响所有 Windows Server 版本（2008 至 2019），CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Microsoft 已分两阶段发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-1472"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-08-17T19:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:01:29Z","remediation":"立即为所有域控制器安装 Microsoft 2020 年 8 月安全更新 (KB4565349) 及后续 2021 年 2 月补丁 (KB4571694)，并启用域控制器上的 \"Domain controller: Allow vulnerable Netlogon secure channel connections\" 组策略为 \"Disabled\"。同时运行 `Test-ComputerSecureChannel -Repair` 验证所有域成员的安全通道状态，对不支持安全 RPC 连接的旧设备设置 \"Account is sensitive and cannot be delegated\" 标记作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2020-09/msg00080.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2020-09/msg00086.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159190/Zerologon-Proof-Of-Concept.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160127/Zerologon-Netlogon-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2020/09/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2020/11/msg00041.html","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/H4OTFBL6YDVFH2TBJFJIE4FMHPJEEJK3/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/ST6X3A2XXYMGD4INR26DQ4FP4QSM753B/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/TAPQQZZAT4TG3XVRTAFV2Y3S7OAHFBUP/","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-1472","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202012-24","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4510-1/","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4510-2/","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4559-1/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/490028","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuApr2021.html","https://www.synology.com/security/advisory/Synology_SA_20_21","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-1472","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49071","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-1472.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-1472_复现.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2020/CVE-2020-1472.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-1472_攻击过程.md","https://github.com/yevh/VulnPlanet/blob/6ed254c94cd8f8f679819ee6af78bb5a7fd96cb9/cve/CVE-2020-1472.md","https://github.com/blackarrowsec/redteam-research/blob/5115a9e46ee414281d309e99b1ea6bc8cf56b326/CVE-2020-1472/README.md","https://github.com/k8gege/CVE-2020-1472-EXP/blob/5660ef8926f5aaf14fab4794e7c45ba05938ad2f/cve-2020-1472-exp.py","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-1472.md","https://github.com/github/dmca/blob/310b083affa51f0d21051ec90bcdbfb004942af1/2023/07/2023-07-19-project-code.md","https://github.com/blaCCkHatHacEEkr/PENTESTING-BIBLE/blob/c458e814010ae369f21cf85e6babcc91722a2650/README.md","https://github.com/bvcyber/CVE-2020-1472","https://github.com/dirkjanm/CVE-2020-1472","https://github.com/risksense/zerologon","https://github.com/VoidSec/CVE-2020-1472","https://github.com/bb00/zer0dump"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0506","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-1464","title":"Microsoft Windows 文件签名验证欺骗漏洞","description":"Windows 签名验证机制存在欺骗漏洞，当 Windows 未能正确验证文件签名时，攻击者可通过加载特制的未正确签名文件绕过安全功能，从而在目标系统上执行未授权的操作。该漏洞允许本地低权限攻击者利用此缺陷加载本应被阻止的恶意文件，导致机密性、完整性和可用性受到高影响。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在安全更新中通过改进文件签名验证方式修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-1464"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-08-17T19:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:01:28Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 8 月安全更新（对应 KB4566782 等月度累积更新），通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。受影响的版本包括 Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8.1、Windows 10（1507/1607/1709/1803/1809/1903/1909/2004）、Windows Server 2008 SP2/2008 R2 SP1/2012/2012 R2/2016/2019。如无法立即打补丁，可配置组策略限制非管理员用户加载未签名文件，并启用 Windows Defender 应用程序控制（WDAC）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.virustotal.com/2019/01/distribution-of-malicious-jar-appended.html","https://krebsonsecurity.com/2020/08/microsoft-put-off-fixing-zero-day-for-2-years/","https://medium.com/%40TalBeerySec/glueball-the-story-of-cve-2020-1464-50091a1f98bd","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-1464","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CV