 KB4566782，Windows 10 1909/1903 版安装 KB4565351，Windows Server 2019/Windows 10 1809 版安装 KB4565349，Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 安装 KB4571703，或通过 Windows Update 自动获取补丁。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），须优先修复。若暂无法打补丁，可通过组策略将 Internet 区域安全级别设为\"高\"并禁用 ActiveX 控件和活动脚本，同时限制 JScript/VBScript 仅在信任站点执行，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/163056/Internet-Explorer-jscript9.dll-Memory-Corruption.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-1380","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-1380","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-1380.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-1380.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-1380_签名伪造.md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【公众号文章】bugs/CVE-2020-1380 签名伪造.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-1380.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-13806.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-13808.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-13809.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-13805.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-13802.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0408.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-0408.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1406","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3433","title":"Cisco AnyConnect Secure Mobility Client for Windows DLL 劫持漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Cisco AnyConnect Secure Mobility Client for Windows 的进程间通信（IPC）通道存在 DLL 劫持漏洞。该漏洞源于应用程序在运行时加载资源时缺乏充分验证，导致搜索路径不受控制。具有 Windows 系统有效凭证的本地认证攻击者可通过向 AnyConnect 进程发送特制的 IPC 消息来触发 DLL 劫持，从而在受影响机器上以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上的 Cisco AnyConnect Secure Mobility Client 4.9.00086 之前的版本，CVSS 评分为 7.8（高危）。Cisco 已在 4.9.00086 版本中修复此漏洞，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3433"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-08-17T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:18:16Z","remediation":"将 Cisco AnyConnect Secure Mobility Client for Windows 升级至 4.9.00086 或更高版本。访问 Cisco Software Center（software.cisco.com），依次选择 Security > VPN and Endpoint Security Clients > Cisco VPN Clients > AnyConnect Secure Mobility Client > AnyConnect Secure Mobility Client v4.x 下载修复版本并安装。该漏洞无临时缓解措施，必须通过版本升级消除风险。升级前请确认设备满足新版本的硬件和内存要求，如无法通过软件中心获取升级文件，请联系 Cisco TAC（https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/web/tsd-cisco-worldwide-contacts.html）并提供产品序列号及本公告链接申请免费升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159420/Cisco-AnyConnect-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-anyconnect-dll-F26WwJW","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3433","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3433.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/9f2a6e9f8ef80998f730c790dd18087952b57414/2020/CVE-2020-3433.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c67c7954c46b752d4b167913e3e046ed998744d0/cves/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3433.json","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/929b6ea1a1a05b6cd00f9afcd22053f36ec0c5dc/modules/exploits/windows/local/anyconnect_lpe.rb","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0b6e820f75229c8af13f7ed779288022b3112db2/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3433.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3435.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2015/CVE-2015-6305.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3434.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3153.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-3433.md","https://github.com/goichot/CVE-2020-3433"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0808","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-17463","title":"Fuel CMS FUEL CMS SQL注入漏洞","description":"Fuel CMS 1.4.7 存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者可在登录后通过向 /pages/items、/permissions/items、/navigation/items 及 /logs/items 等管理页面的 col 参数注入恶意 SQL 语句，利用时间盲注技术（如 SLEEP 函数）绕过认证检测，实现数据库信息窃取、数据篡改甚至完全控制数据库服务器。该漏洞无需用户交互，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。厂商已在 1.4.8 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-17463"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-08-13T13:15:17Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:58:58Z","remediation":"立即将 FUEL CMS 升级至 1.4.8 版本，该版本已修复 /pages/items、/permissions/items 和 /navigation/items 路径中 col 参数的 SQL 注入漏洞。如暂无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙或反向代理层对上述路径的 col 参数实施输入过滤，禁止传入单引号、UNION、SELECT 等 SQL 关键字，并强制限制该参数为整数类型，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158840/Fuel-CMS-1.4.7-SQL-Injection.html","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/89.html","https://getfuelcms.com","https://github.com/daylightstudio/FUEL-CMS/archive/master.zip","https://github.com/daylightstudio/FUEL-CMS/releases/tag/1.4.8","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-17463","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-17463.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-17463.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2020-17463.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2020/17xxx/CVE-2020-17463.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a80088c333d18acfc433e05d369205d159a29769/2020/17xxx/CVE-2020-17463.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/e6513c0b48a121b576b654c0b00e8a0bc6d72f6d/2020/CVE-2020-17463.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/thedaylightstudio/fuel_cms/CVE-2020-17463.yaml","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2020-17463.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-17463.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-17463.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-17463.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0808.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0809","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0809.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-17496","title":"vBulletin 5.x widget_tabbedcontainer_tab_panel 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>vBulletin 5.5.4至5.6.2版本的widget_tabbedcontainer_tab_panel组件在处理ajax/render/widget_tabbedcontainer_tab_panel请求中的subWidgets数据时存在代码注入缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意subWidgets参数向目标站点发送特制HTTP请求，从而在服务器上执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞的产生源于CVE-2019-16759补丁修复不完整，攻击者无需登录即可利用，可导致服务器被完全控制，CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-17496"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-08-12T14:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:59:01Z","remediation":"立即升级到 vBulletin 5.6.3 或更高版本（或应用特定的补丁更新），关闭受支持的版本升级路径的匿名用户注册，此外应限制 AJAX 请求参数验证，仅接受预定义的 trusted 组件类型以阻止恶意子组件数据的提交。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.exploitee.rs/2020/exploiting-vbulletin-a-tale-of-patch-fail/","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html","https://forum.vbulletin.com/forum/vbulletin-announcements/vbulletin-announcements_aa/4445227-vbulletin-5-6-0-5-6-1-5-6-2-security-patch","https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2020/Aug/5","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-17496","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-17496.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-17496.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-17496_vBulletin_Pre-Auth_RCE_漏洞在野利用.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-17496/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2020-17496.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2020/CVE-2020-17496.py","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-7373.md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【公众号文章】bugs/CVE-2020-17496 vBulletin Pre-Auth RCE 漏洞在野利用.md","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2020-17496.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-17496.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-17496.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16759.md","https://github.com/ludy-dev/vBulletin_5.x-tab_panel-RCE","https://github.com/ctlyz123/CVE-2020-17496"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0809.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1888","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1888.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-8218","title":"Pulse Secure Pulse Connect Secure 代码注入漏洞","description":"Pulse Connect Secure（PCS）及 Pulse Policy Secure（PPS）的管理 Web 界面存在代码注入漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制 URI 在目标设备上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响未升级至 9.1R8 版本的产品，攻击者需获得对管理界面的访问权限后方可利用。成功利用后，攻击者可完全控制设备，窃取凭据、横向移动或持久化驻留。Pulse Secure 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户尽快升级并限制管理界面访问范围。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2020-8218"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-30T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:26:04Z","remediation":"立即将 Pulse Connect Secure 升级至 9.1R8 或更高版本以修复该代码注入漏洞。升级前请下载官方固件并校验完整性，升级后验证系统版本。如无法立即升级，应通过防火墙或 ACL 限制管理 Web 界面的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 访问，同时监控 9.1R8 之前的版本是否有异常 URI 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://kb.pulsesecure.net/articles/Pulse_Security_Advisories/SA44516","https://www.gosecure.net/blog/2020/11/13/forget-your-perimeter-part-2-four-vulnerabilities-in-pulse-connect-secure/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-8218","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-8218.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/8afe1cea1339d0905b6a141cc4a89192acfab094/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Script/Exploit/CVE-2020-8218.yara","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2020/8xxx/CVE-2020-8218.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2020/8xxx/CVE-2020-8218.json","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Script/CVE-2020-8218/Exploit_Script_CVE-2020-8218_B.yar","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-8218.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-8218.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-8218.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-8218.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2020/CVE-2020-8218.rules","https://github.com/withdk/pulse-gosecure-rce-poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1888.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0400","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-12812","title":"Fortinet FortiOS SSL VPN 认证绕过漏洞","description":"FortiOS SSL VPN 存在身份认证绕过漏洞（CWE-287），源于用户名大小写处理逻辑缺陷。攻击者只需将用户名中的字母大小写进行变换（如将 `admin` 改为 `Admin`），即可在未提供 FortiToken 双因素认证第二因子的情况下成功登录 SSL VPN 门户。该漏洞影响 FortiOS 6.4.0、6.2.0~6.2.3、6.0.9 及以下版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份凭证即可远程利用，成功后可完全控制目标系统，窃取敏感数据或部署恶意软件。Fortinet 已在 2020 年 7 月安全公告 FG-IR-20-028 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-12812"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-24T23:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:52:20Z","remediation":"立即升级 FortiOS 至 6.4.1 及以上、6.2.4 及以上或 6.0.10 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，在 CLI 中执行 `config user local` → `edit <用户名>` → `set username-case-sensitivity disable` → `next` → `end`，禁用用户名大小写敏感性匹配，防止攻击者通过修改用户名大小写绕过 FortiToken 双因素认证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fortiguard.com/psirt/FG-IR-19-283","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-12812","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-12812.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-12812.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-12812.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2020-12812.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-12812.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2020/CVE-2020-12812/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2020/CVE-2020-12812/README_KO.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2020/CVE-2020-12812.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2020/CVE-2020-12812.json","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2020-12812.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0400.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-0400.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1408","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3452","title":"Cisco ASA/FTD 目录遍历文件读取漏洞","description":"Cisco Adaptive Security Appliance（ASA）Software 和 Cisco Firepower Threat Defense（FTD）Software 的 Web 服务接口存在目录遍历漏洞。由于对 HTTP 请求中的 URL 缺乏充分的输入验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以通过向受影响设备发送包含目录遍历字符序列的特制 HTTP 请求，读取目标设备 Web 服务文件系统中的任意敏感文件。该漏洞影响配置了 WebVPN 或 AnyConnect 功能的 ASA 和 FTD 设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。成功利用该漏洞可使攻击者获取设备上的敏感配置文件等信息，但无法访问 ASA 或 FTD 系统文件及底层操作系统文件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3452"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-22T20:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:18:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cisco ASA Software 至对应分支首个修复版本（9.6 升级至 9.6.4.42、9.8 升级至 9.8.4.20、9.9 升级至 9.9.2.74、9.10 升级至 9.10.1.42、9.12 升级至 9.12.3.12、9.13 升级至 9.13.1.10、9.14 升级至 9.14.1.10），或升级 Cisco FTD Software 至 6.2.3.16、6.4.0.10、6.5.0.5、6.6.0.1 等修复版本；对于受 FMC 或 FDM 管理的设备，请通过相应管理界面执行升级并在升级后重新应用访问控制策略。该漏洞尚无配置层面的变通方案，如无法立即升级，可在 Cisco Firepower 传感器上启用 Snort 规则 54598 至 54601（SRU 2020-07-22-001）以检测和拦截利用尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158646/Cisco-ASA-FTD-Remote-File-Disclosure.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158647/Cisco-Adaptive-Security-Appliance-Software-9.11-Local-File-Inclusion.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159523/Cisco-ASA-FTD-9.6.4.42-Path-Traversal.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160497/Cisco-ASA-9.14.1.10-FTD-6.6.0.1-Path-Traversal.html","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-asaftd-ro-path-KJuQhB86","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3452","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48871","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-3452.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3452.md","https://github.com/Mr-xn/Penetration_Testing_POC/blob/6602db50598d0ed3bff77588ae1140dbe71a025c/web/CVE-2020-3452：Cisco_ASAFTD任意文件读取漏洞.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2020/CVE-2020-3452.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-3452_POC_远程任意文件读取.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/network/cisco/CVE-2020-3452.md","https://github.com/Spacial/awesome-csirt/blob/c68e84b468750ecd1ec144b1a03ab943e8561c4e/PoCs/CVE-2020-3452-cisco-asa.py","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-3452_CISCO_ASA远程任意文件读取.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-3452_CISCO_ASA_远程任意文件读取.md","https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/f4596359a8b7b31ae4d231eeaec711706b892ed2/docs/wiki/iot/Cisco/Cisco ASA设备 任意文件读取漏洞 CVE-2020-3452.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/网络设备漏洞/Cisco ASA设备 任意文件读取漏洞 CVE-2020-3452.md","https://github.com/darklotuskdb/CISCO-CVE-2020-3452-Scanner-Exploiter","https://github.com/cygenta/CVE-2020-3452","https://github.com/PR3R00T/CVE-2020-3452-Cisco-Scanner","https://github.com/0x5ECF4ULT/CVE-2020-3452","https://github.com/3ndG4me/CVE-2020-3452-Exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0308","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-11978","title":"Apache Airflow 默认DAG命令执行漏洞","description":"Apache Airflow 1.10.10及以下版本中自带的示例DAG（有向无环图）存在命令注入漏洞。攻击者在已认证的情况下，可通过向Airflow Web界面中受影响的示例DAG发送特制的HTTP请求，利用示例DAG中未对用户输入进行充分过滤的缺陷，注入任意系统命令。该漏洞可导致远程代码执行，攻击者能够以Airflow worker或scheduler进程的权限在目标服务器上执行任意命令，进而完全控制服务器。若用户已在配置中设置load_examples=False禁用示例DAG，则不受此漏洞影响。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-11978"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-07-17T00:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:51:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache Airflow 至 1.10.11 或更高版本。如无法升级，在 airflow.cfg 中设置 load_examples=False 禁用示例 DAG，并删除 $AIRFLOW_HOME/dags 目录下所有示例文件。同时限制 Airflow Web UI 的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理员网络访问。建议对 Airflow 工作节点实施最小权限原则，避免以 root 用户运行 worker/scheduler 进程。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162908/Apache-Airflow-1.10.10-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/174764/Apache-Airflow-1.10.10-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r7255cf0be3566f23a768e2a04b40fb09e52fcd1872695428ba9afe91%40%3Cusers.airflow.apache.org%3E","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-11978","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-11978.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-11978.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2020-11978.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2020-11978-4451.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web应用漏洞/Apache Airflow 示例DAG中的命令注入 CVE-2020-11978.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/airflow/CVE-2020-11978.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-11978/vultarget/CVE-2020-11978.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-11978/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2020-11978.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-11978/vultarget/CVE-2020-11978-min.py","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/webapp/Apache-Airflow-示例DAG中的命令注入-CVE-2020-11978.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2020/CVE-2020-11978.py","https://github.com/pberba/CVE-2020-11978"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0308.toml"}]